{"schemaVersion":1,"id":231,"sections":[{"id":"358004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20550],"start":0,"count":18},{"id":"358004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20551],"start":18,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:1","scriptId":20550,"text":"再度返回波西娅的帐篷——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:2","scriptId":20550,"text":"“完全没戏，这次只有点蛛丝。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:3","scriptId":20550,"text":"“什么嘛，都给你们地图了，连只蜘蛛都抓不住。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:4","scriptId":20550,"text":"“……真是对不起。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:5","scriptId":20550,"text":"“狼蛛对这里的地形了如指掌，而我们只不过是初来乍到，抓不到它也是无可厚非。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:6","scriptId":20550,"text":"“平地上都不一定能追上它，何况这复杂的山地丛林……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":577,"right":591,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:7","scriptId":20550,"text":"“我不管，反正给我逮住它就行，方法不论！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:8","scriptId":20550,"text":"波西娅的任性脾气又上来了……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:9","scriptId":20550,"text":"“要不我们打埋伏？长官不是最擅长这种的吗~？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":577,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:10","scriptId":20550,"text":"“说得轻巧，无法推测狼蛛的逃跑路线，埋伏什么的根本无从谈起。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:11","scriptId":20550,"text":"讨论陷入了僵局。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":816,"speaker":"妮科尔·奥尔巴赫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:12","scriptId":20550,"text":"“真是对不起……我只会高空侦察……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":816,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:13","scriptId":20550,"text":"“没关系，是那狼蛛跑得太快了，很难追上。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":816,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:14","scriptId":20550,"text":"“等等……我好像有办法了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":816,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:15","scriptId":20550,"text":"“要不下次妮科尔跟我们一起出击？用机枪驱赶狼蛛，这样的话说不定可以找出狼蛛的逃跑路径。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":816,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:16","scriptId":20550,"text":"“哼~动动脑子还是可以的嘛，那就快点出发吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:17","scriptId":20550,"text":"“等……我们需要补给下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-PROLOGUE:20550:18","scriptId":20550,"text":"“那就快去，少给我偷懒！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:1","scriptId":20551,"text":"这次通过妮科尔的高空火力诱导，我们终于对狼蛛的逃跑方式有了些认识。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:2","scriptId":20551,"text":"“下次的话，应该就能逮住那家伙了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:3","scriptId":20551,"text":"“有了妮科尔的机枪驱赶真是方便太多了！下一次一定能抓住它！这次真是只差一点点啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:4","scriptId":20551,"text":"“是啊，没想到诱导射击的效果那么大~”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":572,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:5","scriptId":20551,"text":"“现在只要耐心等待妮科尔补给完成，进行下一次围捕。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":572,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:6","scriptId":20551,"text":"“可以抓紧时间休息，妮科尔补给时间需要一个半小时。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":596,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:8","scriptId":20551,"text":"当我们的围捕工作有了些起色之时，波西娅的帐篷里——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-09.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:10","scriptId":20551,"text":"“这……这狼蛛幼崽的体内存在有原核体的部分物质。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:11","scriptId":20551,"text":"“难道是狼蛛捕食了原核体？还是说原核体与狼蛛融合了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:12","scriptId":20551,"text":"“这种现象有些奇特……难道我找到了战车兽进化的根源？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:13","scriptId":20551,"text":"看着已经被自己解体狼蛛幼崽，波西娅继续自言自语道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:14","scriptId":20551,"text":"“这种新型的蛛丝韧性超越了过去的所有品种……如果用这个制作防弹设备说不定……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:15","scriptId":20551,"text":"“呜嘻嘻嘻～～～卖掉开发专利或者独占蛛丝的来源……感觉能大赚一票啊！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358004-EPILOGUE:20551:16","scriptId":20551,"text":"“真是急死人了，我需要更多的样本！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
